# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000308> (figure)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000308> "Any picture, diagram or table"@en)
