AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000123> "metadata incomplete"@en)
ClassAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000078> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000123>)

